  "stageId": "a003_05",
  "title": "别阻止我",
  "storyCode": "OF-5",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_05_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "50f4e6ccffd50b09bc2e0ce55353875f520d14e175e30a784a920492adad951c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_Festival_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑，我在维多利亚留学这么多年，并不是在虚度光阴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在那里学习了与天灾和源石有关的，最先进的科学技术。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对你来说或许是天方夜谭的事，对我来说却是理所当然并且正在发生的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所学习的知识，我所信奉的理论，它们都在告诉我我的判断是正确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐你学的并不是法学。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛在市政厅做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搜集克洛宁的罪证。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛宁也许很坏，却没有那么蠢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作为天灾信使他不可能不知道现在火山的状况有问题。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他一定是因为自己的盘算才掩盖事实的，只要暗暗搜集他的罪证......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我认为罗德岛和他会正面冲突，所谓暗中搜集证据，不可能成功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没，没关系！只要你不在就......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小姐，我想知道你为什么要这么做。如果我能得到一个合理的答案，我不会追究罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我必须这么做。我不相信父亲是无血无肉的人，他绝对不会看着这种事情发生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "父亲爱着这个城市，比谁都爱，没有人比我更清楚这一点了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你还恨他吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么？如果该恨的话，应该是父亲恨我，因为我的出生带走了母亲......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但他从来没有这么做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是讨厌他不肯把事情说出来，把所有事情全都安排好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来好像是在保护我，实际上却害得我什么都不知道，什么都做不了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就连这次也一样！一定是克洛宁蒙骗了父亲，让他对火山爆发的事情完全不知情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以父亲才会让克洛宁阻止我发布报告！这不叫恨吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火山爆发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "克洛宁说的是，小姐准备把老爷过去的机密事件全部抖露，让老爷退职，接受审判。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？不，我父亲过去做了些什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，没什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......唔，原来是这样，我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以克洛宁也不是因为父亲的命令才阻拦我的。呼，我也差不多明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑，如果真是那种事，我会请求更具备法律效力的渠道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我所做的自然也是为了这个城市，为了我的故乡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。小姐并不在乎过去的事情，也不在乎所谓的名誉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和小姐一样，老爷也一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼。不管别人怎么猜想，我选择相信你，相信父亲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使是目的产生了冲突，我也知道，这是我们两个人之间的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我相信，和我一样了解这个城市的你，一定会知道我会在这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样，你就会亲自来阻止我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，市长是谁都无所谓吧？父亲也一定会这么觉得。他在乎的，不也是这个城市吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，父亲一定会同意我的观点的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "锡兰",
      "speakerId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "黑......我说的对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "speakerId": "char_340_shwaz",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你长大了，小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
